        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat: add Google Cloud Run sandbox provider",
        "body": "## What\n\n`provider: cloud-run-sandbox` — run commands in [Cloud Run sandboxes](https://docs.cloud.google.com/run/docs/code-execution) (preview).\n\n| Mode | How |\n| --- | --- |\n| Remote | Gateway URL + secret → create/exec/delete |\n| Direct | In-container `/usr/local/gcp/bin/sandbox` |\n\nNot `provider: gcp` (Compute Engine SSH).\n\n## Proof (real GCP, then torn down)\n\n```text\nGET /v1/health                         → 200 ok\ndoctor --provider cloud-run-sandbox    → control_plane ready\nrun -- echo ok                         → exit 0 (~1.4s)\nrun -- node -e '…'                     → hello-from-sandbox exit 0\nwarmup → run --id → uname -a → stop    → 4.19.0-gvisor, lease released\n```\n\nProject/service/secrets/gcloud auth cleaned after proof.\n\n## Use\n\n```sh\n# service must have --sandbox-launcher\nexport CLOUD_RUN_SANDBOX_URL=https://….run.app\nexport CLOUD_RUN_SANDBOX_SECRET=…\ncrabbox doctor --provider cloud-run-sandbox\ncrabbox run --provider cloud-run-sandbox -- echo ok\n```\n\nFull GCP setup: `docs/providers/cloud-run-sandbox.md`\n\n## Verify\n\n```sh\ngo test ./internal/providers/cloudrunsandbox/ ./internal/providers/all/\ngofmt -l internal/providers/cloudrunsandbox\nnode scripts/generate-provider-matrix.mjs --check\n```\n\n## Safety\n\n- secrets env-only (never config/argv)\n- gateway URL not from repo YAML\n- egress deny-by-default\n- claims scoped to gateway/cli",
